Doesn't sound like you.

00:42:13.020 --> 00:42:17.080
Niki Lauda didn't give up, if you were given a chance.

00:42:17.740 --> 00:42:22.010
And if you want to become a real racing driver, be a fiend.

00:42:23.360 --> 00:42:27.280
I'm sorry, but I really hate cars.

00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:31.920
You can't drive a car with this kind of fuel.

00:42:31.920 --> 00:42:34.040
The smell of fuel is bad.

00:42:35.120 --> 00:42:37.620
It's not right.

00:42:37.860 --> 00:42:40.220
I love cars.

00:42:40.540 --> 00:42:42.480
And I love this smell.

00:42:42.700 --> 00:42:45.720
It smells good.

00:42:46.020 --> 00:42:51.080
And oil.

00:42:51.380 --> 00:42:53.160
This isn't expensive.

00:42:54.710 --> 00:42:56.090
I want to compete.

00:42:56.610 --> 00:42:58.140
I want to make an impact.

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:04.130
Thank you for everything. I want to compete. I want a car.

00:43:04.270 --> 00:43:05.530
I thought you didn't like cars.

00:43:06.010 --> 00:43:11.200
I love them. I can't live without a car.

00:43:11.420 --> 00:43:14.210
I can't live without a car.

00:43:14.410 --> 00:43:16.380
Watch out, your hands are dirty.

00:43:17.420 --> 00:43:19.120
Now I don't even have a spare tire.

00:43:19.760 --> 00:43:22.030
Good, but don't tell me.

00:43:22.720 --> 00:43:24.470
