Be patient, we'll be in Spain soon.

00:44:27.080 --> 00:44:28.080
We're coming from here, Europe!

00:44:28.630 --> 00:44:29.810
Hopefully we'll be in Europe...

00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:30.900
What?

00:44:31.100 --> 00:44:35.200
I mean the 8-wheel F1. This is my first Grand Prix.

00:44:35.500 --> 00:44:40.580
Very good. The pressure of the machine requires itself to win.

00:44:41.200 --> 00:44:42.760
I'm fighting against myself.

00:44:43.320 --> 00:44:45.280
That's how you can only produce yourself.

00:44:46.070 --> 00:44:46.890
Only myself.

00:44:49.240 --> 00:44:51.190
Did you get hurt?

00:44:56.180 --> 00:44:56.720
I'm sorry.

00:44:57.360 --> 00:44:57.800
I'm sorry.

00:45:19.800 --> 00:45:20.080
Let's go.

00:45:28.390 --> 00:45:28.930
Imagine 1.

00:45:30.060 --> 00:45:42.240
Are you sure you're tired?

00:45:42.930 --> 00:45:45.230
No, I slept pretty well.

00:45:45.560 --> 00:45:46.740
Hmm, that makes me happy.

00:45:47.060 --> 00:45:47.500
How's the car?

00:45:47.840 --> 00:45:51.170
It has been taken to Jarama. Everything is now ready.

00:45:52.280 --> 00:45:53.270
I'm afraid I'll have to wait.

00:45:54.370 --> 00:45:56.610
You're patient. There's still a week left.

00:45:57.050 --> 00:45:58.350
I want to see the track as soon as possible!

00:45:58.590 --> 00:45:59.970
I know what...

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:01.240
I don't know how you feel about it, but...

00:46:01.240 --> 00:46:03.560
On my part, we can go there right away.

00:46:03.740 --> 00:46:05.100
We'll go to the hotel later.

00:46:06.160 --> 00:46:08.330
Good. Tokura, let's go right away.

00:46:08.890 --> 00:46:17.740
30 kilometers from Madrid, we drive to the Espana Grand Prix.

00:46:31.470 --> 00:46:33.740
This is Jarama's track. I want to get on it right away.

00:46:35.640 --> 00:46:36.360
Oh, my child!

00:46:36.800 --> 00:46:38.200
We were just testing the car!

00:46:38.620 --> 00:46:39.640
That's enough!

00:46:41.060 --> 00:46:44.000
Itsusukko's creative team is in excellent shape, as you can see.

00:46:44.380 --> 00:46:45.580
This is his first time.

00:46:46.080 --> 00:46:46.580
Is that so?

00:46:47.360 --> 00:46:56.340
Have a nice day, Katari!

00:46:56.620 --> 00:46:58.900
Have a nice day!

00:47:00.540 --> 00:47:05.720
