00:48:01.360 --> 00:48:12.140
There are a lot of hills and curves in Jaramo.

00:48:12.650 --> 00:48:15.490
There's more than ten curves in three and a half kilometers.

00:48:16.010 --> 00:48:19.310
Look, there's no point in protecting yourself.

00:48:19.450 --> 00:48:21.190
If you crash, you're done for.

00:48:22.340 --> 00:48:24.380
So there's a fight in the curves.

00:48:24.880 --> 00:48:26.960
There is. It's a hell of a motor and brakes.

00:48:27.140 --> 00:48:27.540
Watch out!

00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:39.470
What the hell are you doing? Look, there's the guy you warned a little bit about.

00:48:39.470 --> 00:48:40.460
You almost hit me.

00:48:41.240 --> 00:48:43.140
So the track isn't walking on the guardrail?

00:48:43.460 --> 00:48:44.240
Say that again!

00:48:45.910 --> 00:48:48.750
Stop it, Giida. This is Todoroki.

00:48:48.970 --> 00:48:49.970
How do you know my name?

00:48:51.600 --> 00:48:52.760
Emerson is my friend.

00:48:54.150 --> 00:48:56.250
Then you know that Emerson is Pitipaldi?

00:48:56.410 --> 00:48:59.960
Yes. He is the Brazilian hero who won the world championship and...

