00:49:14.200 --> 00:49:15.400
What did you say?

00:49:15.860 --> 00:49:16.380
Let's go.

00:49:16.480 --> 00:49:18.600
You have to drive an eight-cylinder.

00:49:45.230 --> 00:49:59.380
1 minute 30 seconds!

00:50:00.960 --> 00:50:01.780
30 seconds! Slow down!

00:50:02.820 --> 00:50:06.610
30 seconds! Too far!

00:50:06.990 --> 00:50:09.370
Nikilauda drives a Ferrari at 120kmh!

00:50:21.980 --> 00:50:24.060
I can't even do 1-2-5kmh with this speed!

00:50:25.760 --> 00:50:26.560
Four days later

00:50:26.560 --> 00:50:28.820
a special training was held

00:50:28.820 --> 00:50:29.360
in which...

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:33.830
All drivers compete from the starting position.

00:50:36.610 --> 00:50:37.050
What?

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:04.180
Hunt, Andretti, they are always fast and their powerful cars are really terrible.

00:51:04.500 --> 00:51:11.940
With full throttle Takaya's car Todoroki Special didn't reach the required speed.

00:51:12.340 --> 00:51:18.720
Oh, and now that crazy guy Gida!

00:51:23.420 --> 00:51:25.360
Takaya got to the end of the race just in time.

00:51:25.460 --> 00:51:28.460
He was in the top 20. He starts from the last place.

00:51:32.970 --> 00:51:36.490
I want to increase the horse power. Otherwise, I can't improve the time by even a tenth of a second.

00:51:37.040 --> 00:51:38.700
No, we'll keep the power in front of us.

00:51:38.860 --> 00:51:39.080
