00:51:40.400 --> 00:51:45.540
You're afraid on the maps. If the horse power is increased, you might get out on the maps.

00:51:46.020 --> 00:51:51.280
This was your first race. You'll do better in the finals.

00:51:53.280 --> 00:51:56.220
You're right. Let's go around Madrid.

00:51:56.670 --> 00:51:57.150
Let's go.

00:51:57.440 --> 00:51:59.440
No, Susukulla, there's nothing else I want to do today.

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:02.480
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:52:02.840 --> 00:52:05.170
It's nothing, I'm going alone.

00:52:06.740 --> 00:52:07.060
Nick!

00:52:08.180 --> 00:52:10.060
There's nothing wrong with your car.

00:52:10.340 --> 00:52:10.620
Huh?

