Think about why it has eight wheels.

00:52:14.430 --> 00:52:22.430
Why it has eight wheels?

00:52:22.850 --> 00:52:29.870
I don't know.

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:32.770
It's an eight wheeler. It has to slide easily.

00:52:32.890 --> 00:52:34.860
I don't have to take the maps so carefully.

00:52:35.320 --> 00:52:37.180
I was unthinkable.

00:52:37.320 --> 00:52:37.700
You!

