00:52:52.440 --> 00:52:53.140
Are you Japanese?

00:52:53.560 --> 00:52:53.940
I am.

00:52:54.100 --> 00:52:56.760
I love Japanese people. I'll show you Madrid.

00:53:09.560 --> 00:53:11.950
This is Santa Tilda, my favorite place.

00:53:12.270 --> 00:53:13.350
Santa Tilda?

00:53:13.530 --> 00:53:17.730
I'm looking at this picture in peace.

00:53:18.440 --> 00:53:20.640
Tell me what your real name is.

00:53:20.760 --> 00:53:22.900
Just like this king.

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:33.120
Queen Isabel? So you are Isabel?

00:53:33.420 --> 00:53:36.100
Father gave me a name according to the table.

00:53:36.470 --> 00:53:38.330
Isabel, that's a beautiful name.

00:53:38.770 --> 00:53:39.490
You are a backer.

00:53:39.980 --> 00:53:43.560
A young driver will compete in the Spanish Grand Prix.

00:53:43.880 --> 00:53:44.820
I saw it on the papers.

00:53:45.440 --> 00:53:45.820
Oh, really?

00:53:48.110 --> 00:53:49.370
We'll find you out of everything!

00:53:49.830 --> 00:53:51.050
Shut up!

00:53:54.740 --> 00:53:59.620
It's important, do you hurt the backer?

00:54:14.330 --> 00:54:15.630
