00:54:16.530 --> 00:54:18.710
Isabel, why are you bringing your father to death?

00:54:19.210 --> 00:54:19.810
You are...

00:54:21.560 --> 00:54:25.320
Isabel is my only daughter. She is a part of the Sandro family.

00:54:30.060 --> 00:54:31.620
That's Isabella's mother, Chirico.

00:54:32.260 --> 00:54:33.400
Chirico? Then she...

00:54:33.400 --> 00:54:35.560
Yes, Isabella's mother was Japanese.

00:54:35.960 --> 00:54:37.940
She died soon after Isabella's birth.

00:54:38.880 --> 00:54:39.320
Died?

00:54:40.090 --> 00:54:41.430
Isabella wants to go to Japan.

00:54:42.470 --> 00:54:45.550
The next day we found her at the airport in London and brought her back.

00:54:47.280 --> 00:54:48.060
Then she...

00:54:48.060 --> 00:54:48.840
Isabella!

