00:57:00.890 --> 00:57:01.110
What?

00:57:01.840 --> 00:57:05.200
Isabel meant everything to my brother, and you had to do the same!

00:57:06.800 --> 00:57:11.700
Peter, it's not Takaja's fault! Don't blame Takaja!

00:57:15.260 --> 00:57:18.810
Isabel, stay with Carlos until he's in heaven.

00:57:19.190 --> 00:57:21.510
Yes, father.

00:57:26.420 --> 00:57:28.580
Don't ever come near Isabel again!

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:31.970
Not at all, you hear me?

00:57:52.710 --> 00:57:53.630
It's time for the final race!

00:58:15.840 --> 00:58:19.080
It's 3.4 km long and it revs 90 times.

00:58:20.440 --> 00:58:23.680
If you want to get to a good time with a car that doesn't have enough horsepower,

00:58:24.160 --> 00:58:27.060
you have to drive at the highest possible speed.

00:58:27.280 --> 00:58:29.800
The engine revs don't...

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:35.280
It's time to go down. You have to use the brakes. This way you can reach the top speed in a straight line.

00:58:36.400 --> 00:58:40.740
I can't do anything to Lauda, but I can't lose to Ohina or Gida.

00:58:41.800 --> 00:58:59.960
The next group is expected to be Niki Lauda on the Ferrari, James Hunt on the McLaren, Mario Andretti on the Lotus and Jody Schechter...

00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:00.340
March.

00:59:00.680 --> 00:59:06.300
Fifth round.

00:59:06.700 --> 00:59:08.520
The driver drives the truck to the refueling.

00:59:08.820 --> 00:59:15.410
My position.

00:59:15.750 --> 00:59:16.130
Fifteen.

00:59:16.470 --> 00:59:16.590
Pay.

00:59:17.440 --> 00:59:18.060
Thirteen.

00:59:19.550 --> 00:59:20.470
Tighten even more.

00:59:20.790 --> 00:59:22.200
Got it.

00:59:55.500 --> 00:59:59.960
Starting the 100 kmh mark, the car needs to be changed to a rain-proof tire, but the four-wheel drive...

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:01.780
It takes only 15 seconds to change the gear.

01:00:16.620 --> 01:00:17.060
