01:05:41.950 --> 01:05:51.390
We are in Leipzig.

01:05:52.170 --> 01:05:53.820
This is a beautiful country.

01:05:54.100 --> 01:05:58.820
Yes, after the Vatican, this is the second smallest country in the world.

01:05:59.470 --> 01:05:59.750
Its...

