It's only 149 square kilometers.

01:06:02.850 --> 01:06:05.030
Is this a slaughterhouse?

01:06:05.610 --> 01:06:08.990
That's right, and the heroine of Greyskull came here, Ruhtinatar.

01:06:09.130 --> 01:06:10.730
Look, there's the Monaco Palace.

01:06:12.500 --> 01:06:13.900
It's like a new age's dungeon.

01:06:14.500 --> 01:06:19.920
The Grand Prix of Monaco doesn't run on the race track, but on public roads, which have been closed for this event.

01:06:22.710 --> 01:06:25.110
This time I'll definitely fix what happened in Spain.

01:06:25.940 --> 01:06:27.000
Right position.

01:06:27.380 --> 01:06:27.620
Back.

