The average speed in Monaco was about 132 km per hour last year.

01:08:13.640 --> 01:08:20.020
That's why I think it's best for us to check the engine revs to make sure we have a lot of power throughout the race.

01:08:20.620 --> 01:08:21.140
That's right.

01:08:21.600 --> 01:08:23.320
Keep it in place, Hangaro.

01:08:23.460 --> 01:08:23.940
Is that so?

01:08:24.360 --> 01:08:24.680
That's right.

