01:09:13.010 --> 01:09:13.870
How could you?

01:09:15.000 --> 01:09:18.080
No, no. We talked about it. We talked about it.

01:09:18.360 --> 01:09:21.190
But we didn't do it. We didn't do it.

01:09:21.210 --> 01:09:25.050
That's true. How could we have done it when we've already come this far? Huh?

01:09:26.840 --> 01:09:28.960
Takaiya, believe them. They didn't do it.

01:09:30.190 --> 01:09:30.590
Nice to meet you.

01:09:32.480 --> 01:09:32.920
Takaja!

01:09:33.460 --> 01:09:36.040
I'm deeply disappointed that you doubted my masculinity.

01:09:37.610 --> 01:09:37.950
Sorry.

01:09:39.760 --> 01:09:43.600
Don't underestimate me. I can't win without a snowmobile. I'll give it to you.

01:09:43.840 --> 01:09:53.990
And this is how the training period began.

01:09:54.470 --> 01:09:56.670
Despite the fact that the training period is in question,

01:09:56.670 --> 01:09:59.970
everyone is in hotels, restaurants and stores and watching...

