01:10:18.440 --> 01:10:22.960
And Takaya Todoroki's Qatari Special, which was placed very well in the first straight, is sixth.

01:10:33.840 --> 01:10:34.580
This is the spot.

01:10:35.320 --> 01:10:39.710
The hairpin of the station is the most dangerous part of the Monaco Railway.

01:10:40.010 --> 01:10:53.360
The tunnel also has a hairpin.

01:10:53.460 --> 01:10:55.160
The eyes are quickly getting dark.

01:10:55.460 --> 01:10:56.740
