01:16:56.900 --> 01:16:57.960
F1, of course.

01:17:00.000 --> 01:17:02.980
I want to come with you to Hykkösen. Will you still say that Hyks is better?

01:17:03.420 --> 01:17:04.120
You too!

01:17:06.060 --> 01:17:10.330
Won't this sea last until Japan?

01:17:11.620 --> 01:17:13.230
Of course!

01:17:13.690 --> 01:17:16.450
I want to go to Japan. Take me there!

01:17:17.310 --> 01:17:18.210
You're so smart!

