In the back of the car the gas is starting to boil

01:18:38.690 --> 01:18:45.080
So I put the engine on

01:19:07.230 --> 01:19:09.960
Giida! You're here! Show yourself!

01:19:20.280 --> 01:19:24.560
Go to the Spanish store and ask for Don Quixote in front of the flower shop.

01:19:35.980 --> 01:19:36.660
I want to meet Geed.

01:19:36.780 --> 01:19:37.760
