01:22:56.910 --> 01:22:59.980
Father Bell is going home if you help me, Father Bell.

01:23:02.620 --> 01:23:05.900
I want to be with Takaja. I want to, I want to, I want to...

01:23:13.800 --> 01:23:22.440
You're fine, Takaja. Happy. You've slept so long that I thought you'd never wake up.

01:23:23.070 --> 01:23:28.750
Thank you so much, Isabel. I would never have survived if your father hadn't come to help me.

01:23:30.280 --> 01:23:33.640
My father used to be a skilled Spanish matador.

01:23:34.100 --> 01:23:37.380
Ha ha ha! That's a long time ago, Isabel.

01:23:37.580 --> 01:23:38.960
Thank you very much, Mr. Sandro.

01:23:39.120 --> 01:23:43.750
You too were very good. Would lunch be suitable?

01:23:43.950 --> 01:23:44.930
Lunch at this time?

01:23:45.370 --> 01:23:49.100
