01:25:48.380 --> 01:25:49.620
Mario Andretti was fourth with a Lotus.

01:25:52.630 --> 01:25:54.370
Yölinen drove the worst of Takaja.

01:25:54.630 --> 01:25:59.730
And in the end, the dream dominated Takaja's tired...

01:26:00.000 --> 01:26:00.400
and honey.

